This is a Derivative Work under the Apache License, Section 4(b). Significant
changes from the original Python `mlx-vis` (see README.md and PORTING_NOTES.md
for the full list):

  - Reimplemented in Swift on mlx-swift; the public surface is MLXArray-in /
    MLXArray-out (no numpy / scipy / sklearn).
  - PCA uses a covariance SVD instead of `eigh` (absent in mlx-swift).
  - Added progress hooks (`onEpoch` + `progressEvery`, including an initial frame)
    in place of the Python `epoch_callback`.
  - FFT-accelerated and `compile()`-fused t-SNE / DREAMS repulsive path.
  - Approximate NN-Descent descent loop, brute-force KNN with async pipelining.
  - The t-SNE family shares extracted affinity-graph / repulsion / optimizer
    modules.
  - The GPU rendering / plotting / video layer of the original is NOT ported;
    this package provides the dimensionality-reduction algorithms only.

